<script setup lang="ts">
import {onMounted,ref} from 'vue';import {api,apiMessage} from '@/api/client';import type {RuntimeReport} from '@/metrics';
const value=ref<RuntimeReport|null>(null),busy=ref(false),error=ref('');const time=(minute:number)=>new Date(minute*60000).toLocaleTimeString('zh-CN',{timeZone:'Asia/Shanghai'});
async function load(){busy.value=true;error.value='';try{value.value=(await api.get<RuntimeReport>('/admin/metrics/runtime')).data;}catch(e){value.value=null;error.value=apiMessage(e);}finally{busy.value=false;}}onMounted(load);
</script>
<template><section class="section runtime-metrics" aria-label="轻量运行与请求指标"><header><h2>轻量运行与请求指标</h2><button class="btn" :disabled="busy" @click="load">刷新运行指标</button></header><p v-if="error" role="alert">{{error}}</p><template v-if="value"><p>{{value.note}}</p><p>采集时间：{{value.observedAt?new Date(value.observedAt).toLocaleString('zh-CN',{timeZone:'Asia/Shanghai'}):'尚无可信采集'}} · {{value.available?'采样在新鲜度内':'未知，不当作正常'}} · {{value.logComplete?'日志读取完整':'日志缺失或存在未处理部分'}}</p><p>新增运行告警邮件：{{value.mailAlertsEnabled?'已配置开启，仍受原告警总开关与发件状态控制':'保持关闭；站内事件可核对，生产启用前另行确认'}}。不会根据一次404认定入侵，不自动封禁IP。</p><details><summary>阈值、持续窗口与恢复条件</summary><p>{{value.thresholds}}</p><p>同类邮件30分钟冷却，相同持续故障复用事件；恢复仅在有有效窗口时确认。服务器接受邮件不代表本人收件箱已投递。</p></details><template v-if="value.available"><h3>主机资源最近采样</h3><p>蓝色柱为CPU百分比，纵轴0–100%，横轴为最近15次实际采样顺序；未知CPU不画柱，精确时间与内存见表。缺失时间不补造。</p><svg v-if="value.samples.length" viewBox="0 0 600 115" role="img" aria-label="CPU采样趋势，下方有同源数据表"><line x1="0" y1="100" x2="600" y2="100" stroke="#d8d8df"/><template v-for="(s,i) in value.samples.slice(-15)" :key="s.minute"><rect v-if="s.cpuPercent!==null" :x="i*600/Math.min(15,value.samples.length)" :y="100-s.cpuPercent" :width="500/Math.min(15,value.samples.length)" :height="s.cpuPercent" fill="#002FA7"><title>{{time(s.minute)}} CPU {{s.cpuPercent}}%</title></rect></template></svg><div class="metric-table"><table><thead><tr><th>北京时间</th><th>主机CPU</th><th>主机内存</th><th>本机就绪</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="s in value.samples.slice(-15)" :key="s.minute"><td>{{time(s.minute)}}</td><td>{{s.cpuPercent===null?'首次采样未知':s.cpuPercent.toFixed(1)+'%'}}</td><td>{{(s.memoryUsedBytes/1048576).toFixed(0)}} / {{(s.memoryTotalBytes/1048576).toFixed(0)}} MiB</td><td>{{s.healthy?'通过':'未通过'}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3>请求类别聚合（最多60分钟）</h3><p>HTML请求不等于自愿PV；API与全部请求分开。均值=对应请求总耗时/请求数；零请求时为未知，不冒充P95或网络往返延迟。已识别扫描仅按有限路径类别规则估算，可识别爬虫另计；都不是攻击者人数。</p><div class="metric-table"><table><thead><tr><th>北京时间</th><th>全部请求</th><th>HTML GET</th><th>API请求</th><th>API 5xx</th><th>API均值</th><th>全部5xx</th><th>全部均值</th><th>≥1秒</th><th>登录失败</th><th>429</th><th>扫描类</th><th>爬虫类</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="m in value.minutes" :key="m.minute"><td>{{time(m.minute)}}</td><td>{{m.requests}}</td><td>{{m.htmlRequests}}</td><td>{{m.apiRequests}}</td><td>{{m.apiErrors}}</td><td>{{m.apiRequests?(m.apiDurationMs/m.apiRequests).toFixed(0)+'ms':'未知'}}</td><td>{{m.errors}}</td><td>{{m.requests?(m.durationMs/m.requests).toFixed(0)+'ms':'未知'}}</td><td>{{m.slow}}</td><td>{{m.authFailures}}</td><td>{{m.limited}}</td><td>{{m.scans}}</td><td>{{m.bots}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div></template></template></section></template>
<style scoped>.runtime-metrics{margin:28px 0;padding:24px;background:#fff;min-width:0}.runtime-metrics header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}.runtime-metrics h2{font-size:1.3rem}.runtime-metrics p{font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.9}.metric-table{max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid var(--line)}.metric-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.75rem;white-space:nowrap}.metric-table th,.metric-table td{padding:12px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.runtime-metrics svg{display:block;width:100%;height:160px}.runtime-metrics summary{padding:14px 0;cursor:pointer}@media(max-width:700px){.runtime-metrics{padding:16px}}</style>
